### ============================================================
### LOGIFLOW - TEST ENDPOINTS (VS Code REST Client)
### Instala la extensión "REST Client" para ejecutar con "Send Request"
### ============================================================
### VARIABLES — cambia el host si corres servicios individualmente
###
@host_auth      = http://localhost:8088
@host_clientes  = http://localhost:8086
@host_flota     = http://localhost:8081
@host_pedidos   = http://localhost:8087
@host_ruteo     = http://localhost:8082
@host_taller    = http://localhost:8089
@host_factura   = http://localhost:8084
@host_seguimiento = http://localhost:8083

### ============================================================
### ⚙️  VARIABLES DINÁMICAS
### Después de ejecutar ciertos requests, copia los IDs aquí:
### ============================================================
@roleId     = PEGA-UUID-DEL-ROL-AQUI
@userId     = PEGA-UUID-DEL-USUARIO-AQUI
@clienteId  = PEGA-UUID-DEL-CLIENTE-AQUI
@orderId    = PEGA-UUID-DEL-PEDIDO-AQUI
@shipmentId = PEGA-UUID-DEL-ENVIO-AQUI
@corpAccId  = PEGA-UUID-DE-CUENTA-CORP-AQUI
@vehicleId  = 1


### ============================================================
### 🔐  1. AUTENTICACIÓN Y USUARIOS (Puerto 8088)
### ============================================================

### ── Roles ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ROL] Crear rol CLIENTE
# @name createRoleCliente
POST {{host_auth}}/api/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "CLIENTE",
    "description": "Usuario final que realiza pedidos de envío"
}

###

### [ROL] Crear rol CONDUCTOR
# @name createRoleConductor
POST {{host_auth}}/api/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "CONDUCTOR",
    "description": "Conductor de vehículo de la flota"
}

###

### [ROL] Crear rol OPERADOR
# @name createRoleOperador
POST {{host_auth}}/api/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "OPERADOR",
    "description": "Operador logístico que gestiona pedidos y asignaciones"
}

###

### [ROL] Listar todos los roles
GET {{host_auth}}/api/roles

###

### [ROL] Obtener un rol por ID
GET {{host_auth}}/api/roles/{{roleId}}

###

### [ROL] Obtener rol por nombre
GET {{host_auth}}/api/roles/name/CLIENTE

###

### [ROL] Actualizar descripción de un rol
PUT {{host_auth}}/api/roles/{{roleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "CLIENTE",
    "description": "Cliente actualizado - puede crear y hacer seguimiento de pedidos"
}

###

### [ROL] Eliminar un rol (solo si no tiene usuarios asignados)
DELETE {{host_auth}}/api/roles/{{roleId}}

###

### ── Usuarios ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [USUARIO] Crear usuario completo con datos personales
# @name createUser
POST {{host_auth}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana.garcia@example.com",
    "roleName": "CLIENTE",
    "firstName": "Ana",
    "middleName": "María",
    "lastName": "García López",
    "phone": "0998765432",
    "address": "Av. República del Salvador N34-183, Quito",
    "documentNumber": "1712345678",
    "birthDate": "1995-04-15"
}
### username generado: amgarcial | password = 1712345678

###

### [USUARIO] Crear segundo usuario (verifica username automático: amgarcia → amgarcia1 si existe)
POST {{host_auth}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana.garcia2@example.com",
    "roleName": "CONDUCTOR",
    "firstName": "Ana",
    "lastName": "García",
    "phone": "0987654321",
    "address": "Calle Tamayo N23-56, Quito",
    "documentNumber": "1798765432",
    "birthDate": "1990-08-20"
}
### username generado: anagarcia (o anagarcia1 si ya existe) | password = 1798765432

###

### [USUARIO] Crear usuario — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (sin cédula)
POST {{host_auth}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@test.com",
    "roleName": "CLIENTE",
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "User"
}

###

### [USUARIO] Listar todos los usuarios
GET {{host_auth}}/api/users

###

### [USUARIO] Obtener usuario por ID
GET {{host_auth}}/api/users/{{userId}}

###

### [USUARIO] Obtener usuario por username
GET {{host_auth}}/api/users/username/ana.garcia

###

### [USUARIO] Actualizar datos personales y contraseña
PUT {{host_auth}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Ana María",
    "lastName": "García López",
    "phone": "0912345678",
    "address": "Av. 12 de Octubre N24-660, Quito",
    "newPassword": "NuevaClave@2026"
}

###

### [USUARIO] Desactivar cuenta de usuario
PUT {{host_auth}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "active": false
}

###

### [USUARIO] Asignar rol adicional a usuario
POST {{host_auth}}/api/users/{{userId}}/roles/{{roleId}}

###

### [USUARIO] Revocar rol de usuario
DELETE {{host_auth}}/api/users/{{userId}}/roles/{{roleId}}

###

### [USUARIO] Eliminar usuario
DELETE {{host_auth}}/api/users/{{userId}}

###

### ── Auth (Login / Register) ─────────────────────────────────

### [AUTH] Registro público (crea usuario + Person en un solo paso)
### La contraseña inicial será el documentNumber (cédula)
# @name register
POST {{host_auth}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos.mendoza@logiflow.ec",
    "roleName": "CONDUCTOR",
    "firstName": "Carlos",
    "middleName": "Andres",
    "lastName": "Mendoza Reyes",
    "phone": "0976543210",
    "address": "Calle Veintimilla E7-31, Quito",
    "documentNumber": "0923456789",
    "birthDate": "1988-11-03"
}
### username generado: camendozar | password inicial = 0923456789

###

### [AUTH] Login (la contraseña inicial ES LA CÉDULA del usuario)
# @name login
POST {{host_auth}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "camendozar",
    "password": "0923456789"
}

###

### [AUTH] Login fallido — credenciales inválidas (debe devolver 400)
POST {{host_auth}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "usuario.inexistente",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### [AUTH] Verificar token JWT (pega el token del login aquí)
POST {{host_auth}}/api/auth/verify?token=PEGA-EL-TOKEN-JWT-AQUI


### ============================================================
### 🏢  2. MICROSERVICIO DE CLIENTES (Puerto 8086)
### ============================================================

### [CORP] Crear cuenta corporativa
# @name createCorporateAccount
POST {{host_clientes}}/api/corporate-accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ruc": "1790016919001",
    "businessName": "Tech Logistics Corp S.A.",
    "creditLimit": 25000.00,
    "industry": "Tecnología y Logística"
}

###

### [CORP] Crear cuenta corporativa — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (RUC inválido: 9 dígitos)
POST {{host_clientes}}/api/corporate-accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ruc": "123456789",
    "businessName": "Empresa Inválida",
    "creditLimit": 5000.00
}

###

### [CORP] Listar cuentas corporativas
GET {{host_clientes}}/api/corporate-accounts

###

### [CORP] Obtener cuenta corporativa por ID
GET {{host_clientes}}/api/corporate-accounts/{{corpAccId}}

###

### [CLIENTE] Crear cliente sin cuenta corporativa
# @name createClientSimple
POST {{host_clientes}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "María",
    "lastName": "Torres",
    "email": "maria.torres@example.com",
    "phone": "0991234567",
    "address": "Av. Colón E4-12, Quito"
}

###

### [CLIENTE] Crear cliente asociado a cuenta corporativa
# @name createClientCorp
POST {{host_clientes}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Javier",
    "lastName": "Rodríguez",
    "email": "javier.rodriguez@techlogistics.ec",
    "phone": "0912345678",
    "address": "Parque Empresarial Queri, Guayaquil",
    "corporateAccountId": "{{corpAccId}}"
}

###

### [CLIENTE] Crear cliente — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (teléfono inválido)
POST {{host_clientes}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "Error",
    "email": "test@test.com",
    "phone": "123"
}

###

### [CLIENTE] Listar todos los clientes
GET {{host_clientes}}/api/clients

###

### [CLIENTE] Obtener cliente por ID
GET {{host_clientes}}/api/clients/{{clienteId}}


### ============================================================
### 🚗  3. MICROSERVICIO DE FLOTA (Puerto 8081)
### ============================================================

### [VEHICULO] Crear vehículo — formato ecuatoriano correcto
# @name createVehicle
POST {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plate": "PBA-1234",
    "type": "CAMION",
    "capacityKg": 5000.0,
    "autonomyKm": 800.0,
    "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### [VEHICULO] Crear moto mensajería
POST {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plate": "AZB-456",
    "type": "MOTO",
    "capacityKg": 30.0,
    "autonomyKm": 150.0,
    "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### [VEHICULO] Crear vehículo — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (matrícula incorrecta)
POST {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plate": "AB12345",
    "type": "CAMION",
    "capacityKg": 5000.0,
    "autonomyKm": 800.0,
    "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### [VEHICULO] Crear vehículo — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (capacidad negativa)
POST {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plate": "GHI-789",
    "type": "AUTO",
    "capacityKg": -100.0,
    "autonomyKm": 400.0,
    "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### [VEHICULO] Listar todos los vehículos
GET {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles

###

### [VEHICULO] Obtener vehículo por ID
GET {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}

###

### [VEHICULO] Vehículos disponibles
GET {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles/available

###

### [VEHICULO] Actualizar estado de vehículo
PUT {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plate": "PBA-1234",
    "type": "CAMION",
    "capacityKg": 5000.0,
    "autonomyKm": 800.0,
    "status": "MAINTENANCE"
}

###

### [VEHICULO] Eliminar vehículo
DELETE {{host_flota}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}

###

### [CONDUCTOR] Crear conductor con licencia profesional
# @name createDriver
POST {{host_flota}}/api/drivers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Carlos",
    "lastName": "Mendoza",
    "licenseNumber": "E1234567890",
    "phone": "0987654321",
    "available": true
}

###

### [CONDUCTOR] Crear conductor — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (licencia formato incorrecto)
POST {{host_flota}}/api/drivers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Pedro",
    "lastName": "López",
    "licenseNumber": "LIC-987654321",
    "phone": "0976543210",
    "available": true
}

###

### [CONDUCTOR] Listar todos los conductores
GET {{host_flota}}/api/drivers

###

### [CONDUCTOR] Listar conductores disponibles
GET {{host_flota}}/api/drivers/available


### ============================================================
### 📦  4. MICROSERVICIO DE PEDIDOS (Puerto 8087)
### ============================================================

### [PEDIDO] Crear pedido con campos correctos
# @name createPedido
POST {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clienteId": "{{clienteId}}",
    "customerEmail": "maria.torres@example.com",
    "items": [
        "Caja de Electrónicos - Laptop Dell",
        "Caja de Repuestos - Monitor 27\""
    ],
    "total": 1250.00,
    "weightKg": 45.5,
    "geographicLevel": "NATIONAL",
    "vehicleType": "CAMION",
    "origin": "Quito - Bodega Central Norte, Av. Galo Plaza",
    "destination": "Guayaquil - Sucursal Norte, Km 15 Vía Daule"
}

###

### [PEDIDO] Crear pedido LOCAL liviano
POST {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clienteId": "{{clienteId}}",
    "customerEmail": "javier.rodriguez@techlogistics.ec",
    "items": ["Sobre documentos"],
    "total": 8.50,
    "weightKg": 0.3,
    "geographicLevel": "LOCAL",
    "vehicleType": "MOTO",
    "origin": "Quito - Oficina Central, La Pradera",
    "destination": "Quito - Cliente Final, Cumbayá"
}

###

### [PEDIDO] Crear pedido — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (clienteId no es UUID)
POST {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clienteId": "123",
    "customerEmail": "test@test.com",
    "items": ["Item"],
    "total": 10.00,
    "weightKg": 1.0,
    "geographicLevel": "LOCAL",
    "vehicleType": "MOTO",
    "origin": "Quito Centro",
    "destination": "Quito Norte"
}

###

### [PEDIDO] Crear pedido — VALIDACIÓN FALLIDA (vehicleType inválido)
POST {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clienteId": "{{clienteId}}",
    "customerEmail": "test@test.com",
    "items": ["Item"],
    "total": 10.00,
    "weightKg": 1.0,
    "geographicLevel": "LOCAL",
    "vehicleType": "CAMION_LIGERO",
    "origin": "Quito Centro",
    "destination": "Quito Norte"
}

###

### [PEDIDO] Listar todos los pedidos
GET {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders

###

### [PEDIDO] Obtener pedido por UUID
GET {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

###

### [PEDIDO] Pedido con UUID inválido (debe devolver 400)
GET {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders/esto-no-es-un-uuid

###

### [PEDIDO] Ver pedidos activos de un cliente
GET {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders/active/client/{{clienteId}}

###

### [PEDIDO] Cancelar pedido
POST {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

###

### [PEDIDO] Marcar pedido como entregado
POST {{host_pedidos}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/deliver


### ============================================================
### 🗺️  5. MICROSERVICIO DE RUTEO (Puerto 8082)
### ============================================================

### [RUTEO] Asignar vehículo a un pedido
# @name createShipment
POST {{host_ruteo}}/api/shipments/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
    "customerEmail": "maria.torres@example.com",
    "origin": "Quito - Bodega Central Norte, Av. Galo Plaza",
    "destination": "Guayaquil - Sucursal Norte, Km 15 Vía Daule"
}

###

### [RUTEO] Asignación fallida (orderId no es UUID)
POST {{host_ruteo}}/api/shipments/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderId": "no-es-uuid",
    "customerEmail": "test@test.com",
    "origin": "Quito Centro",
    "destination": "Guayaquil"
}

###

### [RUTEO] Listar todos los envíos
GET {{host_ruteo}}/api/shipments

###

### [RUTEO] Obtener envío por UUID
GET {{host_ruteo}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}


### ============================================================
### 🔧  6. MICROSERVICIO DE TALLER (Puerto 8089)
### ============================================================

### [TALLER] Registrar orden de mantenimiento
# @name createMaintenance
POST {{host_taller}}/api/maintenance/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matricula": "PBA-1234",
    "descripcion": "Cambio de aceite y revisión de frenos — mantenimiento preventivo de 50,000 km"
}

###

### [TALLER] Orden fallida — matrícula inválida
POST {{host_taller}}/api/maintenance/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matricula": "ABC12",
    "descripcion": "Mantenimiento"
}

###

### [TALLER] Orden fallida — descripción demasiado corta
POST {{host_taller}}/api/maintenance/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matricula": "PBA-1234",
    "descripcion": "Corta"
}

###

### [TALLER] Consultar estado de vehículo por matrícula
GET {{host_taller}}/api/maintenance/vehicles/PBA-1234

###

### [TALLER] Consultar vehículo — matrícula inválida (debe devolver 400)
GET {{host_taller}}/api/maintenance/vehicles/AB12


